[00:01.00] 作曲 : Roger Waters
[00:02.00] 制作人 : Roger Waters/David Gilmour/Bob Ezrin
[00:34.70]Hey you, out there in the cold
[00:34.70]喂，那个在冷风中瑟瑟发抖
[00:38.70]Getting lonely, getting old
[00:38.70]漂泊孤独，渐渐老去的你
[00:40.70]Can you feel me?
[00:40.70]你能感受到我吗？
[00:45.70]Hey you, standing in the aisles
[00:45.70]喂，那个站在岔路口
[00:49.70]With itchy feet and fading smiles
[00:49.70]不停飘游 笑容渐逝的你
[00:51.70]Can you feel me?
[00:51.70]你能感受到我吗？
[00:56.70]Hey you, dont help them to bury the light
[00:56.70]喂，请你不要帮助他们埋葬光明
[01:07.70]Don't give in without a fight.
[01:07.70]不要丧失勇气斗争，随便屈服
[01:19.70]Hey you, out there on your own
[01:19.70]喂，那个孤孤零零
[01:23.70]Sitting naked by the phone
[01:23.70]光秃颓废地坐在话筒旁的你
[01:25.70]Would you touch me?
[01:25.70]你可愿意触碰我吗
[01:29.70]Hey you, with you ear against the wall
[01:29.70]喂，那个把耳朵贴在墙上
[01:34.70]Waiting for someone to call out
[01:34.70]苦等别人呼唤自己的你
[01:36.70]Would you touch me?
[01:36.70]你可愿意触碰我吗
[01:41.70]Hey you, would you help me to carry the stone?
[01:41.70]喂，你是否愿意和我一起举起这巨石
[01:51.70]Open your heart, I'm coming home.
[01:51.70]敞开心房，我就要回家了
[02:56.70]But it was only fantasy.
[02:56.70]然而这仅仅是我的幻想
[03:03.70]The wall was too high,
[03:03.70]如你所见
[03:05.70]As you can see.
[03:05.70]这墙是如此之高
[03:11.70]No matter how he tried,
[03:11.70]无论他如何努力
[03:12.70]He could not break free.
[03:12.70]始终无法获得自由
[03:18.70]And the worms ate into his brain.
[03:18.70]蠕虫们侵蚀了他的大脑
[03:54.70]Hey you, out there on the road
[03:54.70]喂，那个走在路上
[03:59.70]always doing what you're told,
[03:59.70]循规蹈矩的你
[04:01.70]Can you help me?
[04:01.70]你可愿意帮帮我？
[04:06.70]Hey you, out there beyond the wall,
[04:06.70]喂，那个漂泊墙外
[04:09.70]Breaking bottles in the hall,
[04:09.70]砸碎酒瓶的人
[04:11.70]Can you help me?
[04:11.70]你是否愿意帮帮我？
[04:16.70]Hey you, don't tell me there's no hope at all
[04:16.70]喂，不要告诉我根本没有希望
[04:27.70]Together we stand, divided we fall.
[04:27.70]团结得获重生，分离必将失败
